    gnd "Bu fikir ne kadar aptalca olsa da, bence aslında işe yarayabilirdi. Konuşmaya başladıktan birkaç dakika sonra gerginliğim geçti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:181
translate turkish jamie7_1d7def9c:

    # pc "It'll be exactly the same when you give it tomorrow. You'll be nervous when you first get out there, then it'll all wash away and you'll just be you."
    pc "Yarın konuşmanı yaptığında da aynen böyle olacak. Sahneye ilk çıktığında gergin olacaksın, sonra her şey unutulacak ve sen sadece kendin olacaksın."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:182
translate turkish jamie7_bea147d7:

    # pc "You'll do great and everybody is going to love it, I promise."
    pc "Harika bir iş çıkaracaksın ve herkes bayılacak, söz veriyorum."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:184
translate turkish jamie7_d41d8cd9_35:

    # voice 'voices/jamie_7_32.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jamie_7_32.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:185
translate turkish jamie7_5a8cd984:

    # gnd "Thanks, [pcname]. I really appreciate your help."
    gnd "Teşekkürler, [pcname]. Yardımın için gerçekten minnettarım."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:186
translate turkish jamie7_33ee9326:

    # pc "And I really appreciate the show."
    pc "Ve gösteri için de çok teşekkür ederim."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:189
translate turkish jamie7_d41d8cd9_36:

    # voice 'voices/jamie_7_33.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jamie_7_33.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:190
translate turkish jamie7_969fb47d:

    # gnd "I bet you do."
    gnd "Eminim öyledir."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:192
translate turkish jamie7_d41d8cd9_37:

    # voice 'voices/jamie_7_34.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jamie_7_34.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:193
translate turkish jamie7_4996d024:

    # gnd "Here's a little something for you to think about when you go to sleep tonight."
    gnd "Bu gece uykuya dalmadan önce üzerinde düşünmen için sana küçük bir şey var."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:194
translate turkish jamie7_47e9d405:

    # pc "Damn, you're killing me here."
    pc "Vay canına, beni mahvediyorsun."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:197
translate turkish jamie7_d41d8cd9_38:

    # voice 'voices/jamie_7_35.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jamie_7_35.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:198
translate turkish jamie7_549d319e:

    # gnd "I'd love to be with you tonight. We'll have to make some time soon."
    gnd "Bu gece seninle birlikte olmak isterdim. Yakında bir zaman ayırmalıyız."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:200
translate turkish jamie7_d41d8cd9_39:

    # voice 'voices/jamie_7_36.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jamie_7_36.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:201
translate turkish jamie7_f47ae404:

    # gnd "I need to go to sleep now though. Have to be ready for that speech. It's pretty important."
    gnd "Ama şimdi uyumam lazım. O konuşmaya hazır olmalıyım. Oldukça önemli."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:202
translate turkish jamie7_df8be67f:

    # pc "Okay. Well good luck."
    pc "Tamam. Peki, iyi şanslar."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:205
translate turkish jamie7_d41d8cd9_40:

    # voice 'voices/jamie_7_37.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jamie_7_37.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:206
translate turkish jamie7_32592d9e:

    # gnd "Thanks, [pcname]. Good night."
    gnd "Teşekkürler, [pcname]. İyi geceler."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:207
translate turkish jamie7_e32c95cf:

    # pc "Good night, Jamie."
    pc "İyi geceler, Jamie."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:209
translate turkish jamie7_00e0c49a:

    # "We hang up, but I watch her just a little longer as she walks over to the lamp beside her bed."
    "Telefonu kapattık, ama o yatağının yanındaki lambaya doğru yürürken onu biraz daha izledim."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:211
translate turkish jamie7_62544acf:

    # "Then she turns it off and the show is over."
    "Sonra lambayı kapattı ve gösteri sona erdi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:213
translate turkish jamie7_55c194a5:

    # "I guess I should get some sleep too."
    "Sanırım ben de biraz uyumalıyım."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie7.rpy:214
translate turkish jamie7_5ef2b12b:

    # "I lie down and fall asleep, thinking about Jamie."
    "Jamie’yi düşünerek uzandım ve uykuya daldım."

